{"type":"text","text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vector tile source is added to an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle"},{"type":"text","text":" object along with one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer"},{"type":"text","text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeCollection":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapecollection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeCollection"},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a shape consisting of zero or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinct but related shapes that are ins